msgid ""
"The Meal Vouchers report allows employers to generate a summary of meal "
"vouchers granted to employees\n"
"                    for a given period. It helps track the number of "
"vouchers allocated based on worked days and ensures\n"
"                    compliance with Belgian regulations regarding employer "
"and employee contributions."
msgstr ""
"Der Bericht für Mahlzeitschecks ermöglicht Arbeitgebern, eine Übersicht über "
"die den Mitarbeitern\n"
